  "metadata": {
    "job": "Drink coaster",
    "revision": "A",
    "notes": "Each job is a layer with its own beam recipe, the way LightBurn organises one. Re-tune the Engrave layer's power and both rings follow — the operations read their numbers from the layer. Both engraves run before the cut: once the outline is severed the coaster is loose on the bed."
  },
